                "username": "TohmaMasaki"
              }
            ]
          },
          "text": "Happy Birthday, Towa-sama! 💜\nToday is Towa-sama's birthday! 🎂\nTowa has always been a character I really enjoy kigging, but she was deceptively difficult to put together. Her outfit may look relatively simple, but getting everything right took quite a bit of work.\nFor instance, her off-the-shoulder jacket took a few attempts to get right, along with all the little details, even down to her two-colored fingernails. Altogether, it took almost four months to get everything in place before her first photoshoot.\nBut in the end, I'm really happy with how she turned out, and I've really enjoyed kigging as her ever since. She's actually become one of the characters I feel most confident kigging as, especially at conventions and other public events.\nTMT! 💜👾\n\n📷: @TohmaMasaki \n#TOWART"
        },
